---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Work" description="The work Fritz Knack does across arts leadership, technology, and civic life.">
  <header class="work-hero">
    <div class="work-copy max-w-6xl mx-auto px-lg">
      <p class="eyebrow">Work · current and ongoing</p>
      <h1>Make good things work better.</h1>
      <p>I’m most useful where people, processes, and purpose have become tangled—and where a practical next step matters more than a grand theory.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="work-steps" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
  </header>
  <section class="work-list max-w-6xl mx-auto px-lg py-4xl">
    <article><span>01</span><div><h2>Arts leadership</h2><p>Steadying organizations, supporting creative work, and helping arts institutions serve their communities with clarity and care.</p></div></article>
    <article><span>02</span><div><h2>Useful systems</h2><p>Turning unwieldy technology, information, and workflows into tools that people can actually understand and use.</p></div></article>
    <article><span>03</span><div><h2>Civic service</h2><p>Showing up for local work, bringing people together, and helping good intentions become durable practice.</p></div></article>
  </section>
</Layout>
<style>
  .work-hero { position: relative; min-height: 39rem; overflow: hidden; background: #edf1ec; }
  .work-copy { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding-top: var(--spacing-3xl); }
  .work-copy h1 { max-width: 10ch; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 8rem); line-height: .82; }
  .work-copy > p:last-child { max-width: 36rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem 1rem 0; background: #edf1ec; font-size: 1.3rem; }
  .work-steps { position: absolute; inset: auto 0 0 42%; height: 19rem; }
  .work-steps i { position: absolute; right: 0; height: 5.2rem; background: #315a52; }
  .work-steps i:nth-child(1) { bottom: 0; width: 100%; }
  .work-steps i:nth-child(2) { bottom: 6.6rem; width: 76%; background: #a54332; }
  .work-steps i:nth-child(3) { bottom: 13.2rem; width: 48%; background: #315a52; }
  .work-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(5rem, .3fr) 1fr; gap: var(--spacing-lg); padding: var(--spacing-2xl) 0; border-top: .55rem solid var(--color-ink); }
  article:nth-child(2) { margin-left: 8%; border-color: #a54332; }
  article:nth-child(3) { margin-left: 16%; border-color: #315a52; }
  article > span { font-family: var(--font-mono); color: var(--color-mute); }
  h2 { font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 5rem); }
  p { max-width: 42rem; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .work-hero { min-height: 42rem; } .work-steps { left: 18%; height: 15rem; } article, article:nth-child(n) { margin-left: 0; grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr; } }
</style>
